  "description": "Beryy - A side-panel browser agent for Chrome that reads, clicks, types, and navigates the web with your permission. Supports NVIDIA NIM, Google AI Studio, Groq, OpenRouter, local Ollama, and any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Features vision, auto context compaction, tracker blocking, persistent chats, and granular permissions.",
